41167	41232	41131	41132	the Captain	5812	“ No , I ’m sure your pretty arms were never meant for such heavy weights . But you go out a walk sometimes these pleasant evenings , do n’t you ? Why do n’t you have a walk in the Chase sometimes , now it ’s so green and pleasant ? I hardly ever see you anywhere except at home and at church . ”
