41255	41264	41253	41253	Hetty	193	“ But I go through the Chase sometimes . ”
41265	41292	41131	41132	the Captain	5812	“ And do n’t you ever go to see Mrs. Best , the housekeeper ? I think I saw you once in the housekeeper ’s room . ”
41293	41341	41253	41253	Hetty	193	“ It is n’t Mrs. Best , it ’s Mrs. Pomfret , the lady ’s maid , as I go to see . She ’s teaching me tent - stitch and the lace - mending . I ’m going to tea with her to - morrow afternoon . ”
41430	41435	41437	41438	the captain	5812	“ Here she is ! ”
41452	41473	41437	41438	the captain	5812	“ Here ’s Totty ! By the by , what ’s her other name ? She was n’t christened Totty . ”
41474	41544	41437	41438	the captain	5812	“ Oh , sir , we call her sadly out of her name . Charlotte ’s her christened name . It ’s a name i ’ Mr. Poyser ’s family : his grandmother was named Charlotte . But we began with calling her Lotty , and now it ’s got to Totty . To be sure it ’s more like a name for a dog than a Christian child . ”
